    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d133-a8">

                <pb facs="0267" n="175" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg175"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Fowler</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States of America</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Pekin, China</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1899-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July 7,
                                1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received your dispatch No. 191, of
                    July 3, with its inclosed letter from Revs. Johnson and Chalfant.</p>
                <p>Before this can reach you I trust they will have received my communication of the
                    3d instant and that a satisfactory settlement of the case may be well under
                    way.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. H. Conger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
